1 FlatCFM/
2 ├── data/                  # Data loading, splitting, and simulation
3 │   ├── dataset.py         # PyTorch Datasets (CondFMDataset)
4 │   ├── samplers.py        # Custom batch samplers
5 │   ├── splitters.py       # Logic for train/val/test splits (OOD, random)
6 │   ├── simulations.py     # Toy dataset generators (Gaussian to Moons)
7 │   └── space.py           # SpaceManager: Bi-directional space transformations
8 ├── models/                # Neural network architectures and baselines
9 │   ├── autoencoder.py     # NBAutoEncoder and its components
10 │   ├── flow.py            # CondFlow, ConditionEncoder, and ODE logic
11 │   └── baselines.py       # Interface and implementations of baseline models
12 ├── training/              # Training loops and modular losses
13 │   ├── losses.py          # Composable loss registry (KL, Pullback, Recon)
14 │   ├── trainer_ae.py      # Autoencoder training loop
15 │   └── trainer_flow.py    # Flow Matching training loop
16 ├── evaluation/            # Metrics and visualization
17 │   ├── metrics.py         # MMD, E-distance, 2-WD, Rank, Cosine logFC
18 │   └── plotting.py        # UMAPs, Volcano plots, trajectory visualizations
19 └── scripts/               # Entry points for running experiments
20     ├── train_ae.py
21     ├── train_flow.py
22     └── run_baselines.py


train_ode_sciplex.ipynb → train_fm_sciplex.ipynb → benchmark_real.ipynb

